   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of the city of Yonkers",
    "basePrintNo": "S3463",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3463-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S3463\n\nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the local finance law, in relation to\nbonds and notes of the city of Yonkers\n\nPURPOSE: Extender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on\nserial bonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2015 to June 30, 2016.\n\nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one of the bill amends Section 54.40 of the local finance law\nas amended by chapter 70 of the laws of 2014 to extend the city's\nauthorization to issue bonds and notes through negotiated sale to June\n30, 2016\n\nJUSTIFICATION: Extender law - this bill extends the marketing\nlimitation on serial bonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2015 to June\n30, 2016, The authorization for Yonkers to negotiate the private sales\nof its bonds or notes is vital to improving the city's financial\nstability and independence  The city's bonding authority will expire\non June 30, 2015 unless it is extended for one year. The continuation\nof this power will allow more cost-effective financing for the city of\nYonkers,.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:  2014 - S6313 - Extender Law - Chapter 70 2013 -\nS3020 - Extender Law - Chapter 69 2012 - S6460 - Extender Law -\nChapter 72 2011 - S2982 - Extender Law - Chapter 66 2010 - S6720 -\nExtender Law - Chapter 125 2009 - S3336 - Extender Law - Chapter 77\n2008 - S6878 - Extender Law - Chapter 144\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS: None to the State.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:  This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
